# DeepWood client config for PRODUCTION builds.
#
# Committed on purpose. Every value here is public information:
#   - the RPC is a public endpoint on the chain's own domain, no API key
#   - VITE_GAME_ADDRESS / VITE_TOKEN_ADDRESS are contract addresses, public by
#     definition -- they are in the browser's network tab either way
#   - VITE_CHAIN_ID is a number
#
# There is no credential in this file. Anything secret (a key, a bearer token,
# a provider URL with an embedded key) belongs in a Vercel PROJECT env var and
# must NEVER be committed here -- the VITE_ prefix means Vite inlines the value
# into the public bundle, readable by anyone who loads the site.
#
# .env.local (gitignored) still overrides this locally.
VITE_RPC_URL=https://rpc.testnet.chain.robinhood.com
VITE_GAME_ADDRESS=0xCDAd67Ed7165a42a74A7324275Da11f0F9f98b8A
VITE_CHAIN_ID=46630
VITE_TOKEN_ADDRESS=0xF049d0076c2f25A763551beD760aB55e905ea831
